OL,3,AQuestions mount over what an AI
OL,4,A'slowdown' would look like
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been no shortage of warnings
OL,7,Ffrom AI's top bosses about existential
OL,8,Fthreats over the years.
OL,10,FI attended the world's first AI safety
OL,11,Fsummit in Bletchley Park in November
OL,12,F2023 where the focus was on the most
OL,13,Fserious threats imaginable, posed by
OL,14,Fthe most powerful AI models.
OL,16,FAt the time, many thought this was in
OL,17,Fthe realm of sci-fi and the real
OL,18,Fthreats were comparatively far more
OL,19,Fmundane: job losses, cheating in exams.
OL,20,FThree years later, many of those same
OL,21,Fvoices don't seem to be so sure.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
